{"about_the_game":"Your uncle\u2019s once-thriving jewelry shop is crumbling, and it\u2019s your job to bring it back to life! Mine precious ore, smelt it into shiny jewelry, add rare gemstones and sell to every customer who walks in. Mine by day, sell by night, solo or in co-op, and become a successful merchant!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/bb6ca37d5dda70754f7028d1ab155b8c.poster.avif?t=1771672342\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/bb6ca37d5dda70754f7028d1ab155b8c.webm?t=1771672342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/bb6ca37d5dda70754f7028d1ab155b8c.mp4?t=1771672342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mine the Underground</h2>Head into the depths to dig up precious gems, rare metals, and hidden treasures. Play solo or team up in 4 player co-op to extract materials needed to craft goods for your shop.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/826bdd2bac758dc5c6a3c9af06adfac9.poster.avif?t=1771672342\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/826bdd2bac758dc5c6a3c9af06adfac9.webm?t=1771672342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/826bdd2bac758dc5c6a3c9af06adfac9.mp4?t=1771672342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft shiny jewelry</h2>Turn raw materials into shiny rings, necklaces, and other sparkly goods. Smelt, shape, and set gems with a satisfying, physics-based crafting system.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/1e6567b267f2d807dcbce0cd108126fe.poster.avif?t=1771672342\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/1e6567b267f2d807dcbce0cd108126fe.webm?t=1771672342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/1e6567b267f2d807dcbce0cd108126fe.mp4?t=1771672342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run (and Save) the Family Shop</h2>Your uncle\u2019s once-thriving shop is now a mess, and it\u2019s up to you to turn it around. Stock the shelves, serve picky customers, and rebuild your reputation from the ground up.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/b66dc170f63bdc6d0e04dc871683f060.poster.avif?t=1771672342\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/b66dc170f63bdc6d0e04dc871683f060.webm?t=1771672342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/b66dc170f63bdc6d0e04dc871683f060.mp4?t=1771672342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade everything</h2>Level up to mine faster, dig deeper, and carry more loot. Expand your shop with new floors and upgrade each room to build a booming business.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/e7d74930f7a88960ed2554403aa48610.poster.avif?t=1771672342\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/e7d74930f7a88960ed2554403aa48610.webm?t=1771672342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/e7d74930f7a88960ed2554403aa48610.mp4?t=1771672342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Solo or in Co-op</h2>Play alone at your own pace or team up with up to 4 people in online co-op! Share the work, pool your profits, and run your operation together.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/c010726e44346d157425ac3220e3c350.poster.avif?t=1771672342\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/c010726e44346d157425ac3220e3c350.webm?t=1771672342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/c010726e44346d157425ac3220e3c350.mp4?t=1771672342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Mine gems, rare metals, and other valuable resources underground<br></li><li>Craft shiny jewelry with a satisfying, interactive crafting system<br></li><li>Run your shop: stock shelves, help customers, and build your reputation<br></li><li>Level up and upgrade your mechs, truck, character and shop<br></li><li>Play solo at your own pace or team up with up to 4 people in online co-op<br></li><li>Find inner peace with casual, relaxing, and rewarding gameplay</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3744080?t=1771672342","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/43134ea80ccfc2343c77dbec5ce051db93b2163c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771672342","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/5776e7ebb35056cb9daf2dca38ce369e824864b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771672342","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/5776e7ebb35056cb9daf2dca38ce369e824864b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771672342","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3843030,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"Your uncle\u2019s once-thriving jewelry shop is crumbling, and it\u2019s your job to bring it back to life! Mine precious ore, smelt it into shiny jewelry, add rare gemstones and sell to every customer who walks in. Mine by day, sell by night, solo or in co-op, and become a successful merchant!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/bb6ca37d5dda70754f7028d1ab155b8c.poster.avif?t=1771672342\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/bb6ca37d5dda70754f7028d1ab155b8c.webm?t=1771672342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/bb6ca37d5dda70754f7028d1ab155b8c.mp4?t=1771672342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mine the Underground</h2>Head into the depths to dig up precious gems, rare metals, and hidden treasures. Play solo or team up in 4 player co-op to extract materials needed to craft goods for your shop.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/826bdd2bac758dc5c6a3c9af06adfac9.poster.avif?t=1771672342\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/826bdd2bac758dc5c6a3c9af06adfac9.webm?t=1771672342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/826bdd2bac758dc5c6a3c9af06adfac9.mp4?t=1771672342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft shiny jewelry</h2>Turn raw materials into shiny rings, necklaces, and other sparkly goods. Smelt, shape, and set gems with a satisfying, physics-based crafting system.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/1e6567b267f2d807dcbce0cd108126fe.poster.avif?t=1771672342\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/1e6567b267f2d807dcbce0cd108126fe.webm?t=1771672342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/1e6567b267f2d807dcbce0cd108126fe.mp4?t=1771672342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run (and Save) the Family Shop</h2>Your uncle\u2019s once-thriving shop is now a mess, and it\u2019s up to you to turn it around. Stock the shelves, serve picky customers, and rebuild your reputation from the ground up.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/b66dc170f63bdc6d0e04dc871683f060.poster.avif?t=1771672342\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/b66dc170f63bdc6d0e04dc871683f060.webm?t=1771672342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/b66dc170f63bdc6d0e04dc871683f060.mp4?t=1771672342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade everything</h2>Level up to mine faster, dig deeper, and carry more loot. Expand your shop with new floors and upgrade each room to build a booming business.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/e7d74930f7a88960ed2554403aa48610.poster.avif?t=1771672342\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/e7d74930f7a88960ed2554403aa48610.webm?t=1771672342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/e7d74930f7a88960ed2554403aa48610.mp4?t=1771672342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Solo or in Co-op</h2>Play alone at your own pace or team up with up to 4 people in online co-op! Share the work, pool your profits, and run your operation together.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/c010726e44346d157425ac3220e3c350.poster.avif?t=1771672342\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/c010726e44346d157425ac3220e3c350.webm?t=1771672342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/extras/c010726e44346d157425ac3220e3c350.mp4?t=1771672342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Mine gems, rare metals, and other valuable resources underground<br></li><li>Craft shiny jewelry with a satisfying, interactive crafting system<br></li><li>Run your shop: stock shelves, help customers, and build your reputation<br></li><li>Level up and upgrade your mechs, truck, character and shop<br></li><li>Play solo at your own pace or team up with up to 4 people in online co-op<br></li><li>Find inner peace with casual, relaxing, and rewarding gameplay</li></ul>","developers":["Delayed Victory"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744080/f1e021c9cfe9d12460becb4cdac562717b80cafe/header.jpg?t=1771672342","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9Copyright Delayed Victory. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3744080/1795038002/15bfb4c808a8c40c8ce82857dd786849d6e88994/1771598385/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771670674","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3744080/1795038002/15bfb4c808a8c40c8ce82857dd786849d6e88994/1771598385/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771670674","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3744080/1795038002/15bfb4c808a8c40c8ce82857dd786849d6e88994/1771598385/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771670674","id":257182277,"name":"Mining Merchant - Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akama